{
  "_comment": [
    "Golden vectors for the promotion engine. The C# engine (ShelfGuard.Application/Features/Promotions/PromotionEngine.cs) and the cashier TypeScript mirror MUST both pass every vector. Do not edit an expectation to make one side pass: fix the engine.",
    "Schema v1. Top level: { _comment, schema, vectors: [ { name, context, rules, lines, expected } ] }.",
    "context: { storeId, at (ISO-8601 UTC instant), utcOffsetMinutes (store-local offset for weekday/time scope, default 0), membership: null | { id, tierId (nullable), tierPercent (loyalty tier discount %, 0 = none) } }.",
    "rules: [ { id, versionId, name (receipt label), createdAt (ISO, 'older rule' tie-break), definition } ]; definition = the promotion-rules.md JSON. Omitted definition fields take defaults: targets {itemIds:[],categoryIds:[]}, scope {} (all stores, always), audience {kind:'all'}, limits {maxApplicationsPerReceipt:null}, excludeAlreadyDiscounted false, priority 100, params.matchMode 'per_item'.",
    "lines: [ { itemId, categoryId (nullable), unitPrice (pre-promo price incl. stock discount), quantity, hasStockDiscount (default false), regularPrice (shelf price, tier base; default unitPrice) } ].",
    "expected: one array per input line of segments { quantity, unitPrice, ruleId (null = regular or tier price), label (null when ruleId null) } in engine order; segment quantities sum to the line quantity.",
    "Money: promo unit price = clamp(round(x, 2, half AWAY from zero), 0.01, unitPrice), a candidate only when strictly below unitPrice. Tier unit price = max(0, unitPrice - round(regularPrice * tierPercent / 100, 2, half to EVEN)). Priority tie-break: lower number wins, then older createdAt, then id string. validFrom inclusive, validTo exclusive, timeFrom inclusive, timeTo exclusive (timeFrom > timeTo = across midnight), weekdays ISO 1=Mon..7=Sun.",
    "Full algorithm: see the PromotionEngine class summary (unit expansion, best simple price, buy_n_get_m group selection by largest gain, capacity-aware simple assignment, segment merge)."
  ],
  "schema": "promotion-engine-golden-vectors/v1",
